---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import { Content as Intro } from '../content/home-intro.md'
import sections from '../data/sections.yaml'
---

<Base
  title="Het's Website"
  cover="/covers/journey.jpg"
  coverPosition="center 73.57%"
  coverCaption="still from one of the most beautiful games i have ever played (journey)"
>
  <h1>Het’s Website</h1>

  <Intro />

  <div class="contact-row">
    <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=916351492258">WhatsApp</a>
    <a href="mailto:2522het.patel@gmail.com">Email</a>
    <a href="http://twitter.com/hetnothate">Twitter</a>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/het-patel-81526a18b/">LinkedIn</a>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <p>
    This website is an attempt at getting myself to write and put myself out
    there more often. Most of what (I hope to) share will broadly fall into one
    of three categories.
  </p>

  {
    sections.map((s) => (
      <details class="section">
        <summary>
          <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▸</span>
          <h2>{s.title}</h2>
        </summary>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p class="muted">{s.blurb}</p>
          {s.pages && (
            <ul class="page-list">
              {s.pages.map((p) => (
                <li>
                  <a class="arrow-link" href={p.href}>{p.label}</a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          )}
          {s.groups &&
            s.groups.map((g) => (
              <>
                <h3>{g.name}</h3>
                {g.items?.length ? (
                  <ul class="media-list">
                    {g.items.map((it) => (
                      <li>
                        <a class="arrow-link" href={it.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
                          {it.title}
                        </a>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                ) : (
                  <p class="muted">Nothing here yet.</p>
                )}
              </>
            ))}
        </div>
      </details>
    ))
  }

  <hr />

  <p class="muted">
    Right now, this is like a fresh notebook with just my name on the first
    page. Hopefully I’ll have more ‘pages’ by the time of your next visit :”)
  </p>
</Base>
